data: {"type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT", "timestamp": 1793187652876, "messageId": "4c8d623b4e", "delta": "No design meets 100% of the heat with no boilers, chillers or heat pumps. The 1 km doublet covers 0% of the heat, 61.8 GWh a year short. Its brine reaches only 39.8 °C at the wellhead, below the 70 °C the network needs. Options: The same 1 km doublet with heat pumps and a peak boiler: 100% of the heat at 70.8 €/MWh. A 2.2 km doublet under the same limits: 65.4% of the heat at 41.3 €/MWh. A1, the 2.5 km cascade with heat pump, boiler and absorption chiller: 100% of the heat at 41 €/MWh."}

